3. **Modular Design**: Consider organizing validation logic and formatting features into separate components or modules. This would promote code reuse and maintainability across the application, addressing different aspects of validation and formatting independently. 

By following these strategic insights and implementation guidance, the project can improve in robustness and feature completeness.

